  "description": "Microsoft AntiSSRF is a security library that helps .NET developers protect their applications from Server-Side Request Forgery (SSRF) attacks. The library provides configurable policies to validate and filter outbound HTTP requests, preventing attackers from exploiting server-side functionality to access internal resources or perform unauthorized network requests. Features include IP address validation, URL filtering, and custom policy configuration.",
